	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I've received a divine revelation! 'Oomikami Radio, Oomikami Radio～♪ Playing Nothing But Humanity's Number One Hit～♪'”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure say the strangest things sometimes, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do beg your pardon, Soujin-sama, Akari-sama, but might I presume to trouble you with a question?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why so formal all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Or rather, Mitsurugi-sama was created by the Founding Empress, yes?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then how was it that you were able to sire a child with Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What! Are! You! Talking! About! In! Broad! Daylight!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But, but, and please pardon my impertinence, it is almost as though a mere spellblade had begotten a child! I find it most inconceivable!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm, I suppose that is a fair question.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But when you attain the domain of 'heart and blade in\nconcord,' siring a child is a trivial matter.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I see! The core precept of the Inou School is profound indeed!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, no. It's not like 'heart and blade in concord' is some omnipotent mantra, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But then how would you explain it, Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Well, maybe the Founding Empress just made him that way?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Her realm was teetering on the brink of ruin, yet she thought to add such a function to her ultimate weapon?!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh... I guess so?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She had the power to see the future, so she must have deemed it necessary.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think she knew the problem of succession would come up sooner or later.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“So the Founding Empress used her magicks not only to save her realm, but also to create her ideal man...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I feel terribly guilty for saying this, but...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That's sad.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As a woman... yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But when you're an Empress, I suppose you just have to...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My, what a ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"fascinating",
{"/font"},
" conversation.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It seems you two need a lesson from a veeery sad woman.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Your Majesty?!” “Eeeeeep?!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It was through a simple miracle of love that Mitsurugi managed to sire a child.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Isn't that right, Tokita?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'm pretty sure it was 'heart and blade in─'”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“To Ne no Kuni with all of you!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
